    studies:[{title:'PT-141 for Female Sexual Dysfunction: Phase 3',journal:'JAMA 2019',summary:'Bremelanotide significantly improved sexual desire and reduced distress in premenopausal women with HSDD. FDA approved as Vyleesi.',pmid:'31116916',url:'https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/31116916/'},{title:'Intranasal Oxytocin Increases Trust and Bonding',journal:'Nature 2005',summary:'Intranasal oxytocin significantly increased trust behavior. Landmark demonstration of oxytocin modulating human social behavior.',pmid:'15931222',url:'https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/15931222/'},{title:'Selank Anxiolytic Effects vs Diazepam',journal:'Bulletin of Experimental Biology 2008',summary:'Significant anxiolytic effects comparable to diazepam without sedation or memory impairment. No dependency risk.',pmid:'19145268',url:'https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/19145268/'}],
    plainEnglish:`Think of the brain's intimacy circuits as a building's hospitality wing — a section designed specifically for connection, presence, and being fully open to another person.\n\nThat wing has three separate systems that all need to be online simultaneously: the main power that drives desire, the ambient environment that creates genuine connection, and a security alarm that has a habit of going off at exactly the wrong moment and clearing the room.\n\nThis stack powers all three up and shuts the false alarm down. All three taken together, 45–60 minutes before.\n\n**PT-141 — The Main Power Switch**\n\nPT-141 activates MC4R receptors in the hypothalamus — the deep brain circuit that generates sexual desire itself. This isn't a vascular effect like Viagra. It's the main power switch for the hospitality wing being flipped on at the source. Works for both men and women. FDA-approved for female sexual dysfunction (Vyleesi).\n\n**Oxytocin — The Ambient Environment**\n\nMain power makes the wing functional. Oxytocin makes it warm. It's the bonding molecule — the one that creates trust, deepens connection, and shifts the experience from physical function to genuine presence with another person. The crew that sets the lighting, the temperature, and the atmosphere.\n\n**Selank — Disabling the False Alarm**\n\nPerformance anxiety is a security alarm that triggers on its own and empties the room at exactly the wrong moment. Selank modulates GABA-A to disable that alarm without sedation — the operators are fully present, the false alarm just stops going off.\n\n| Compound | Role |\n|---|---|\n| PT-141 | Main power switch — activates the brain's desire circuit at the source |\n| Oxytocin | Sets the ambient environment — warmth, trust, genuine connection |\n| Selank | Disables the performance anxiety alarm that clears the room |\n\n---\n\nPower, environment, no interruptions. Main power opens the wing. Oxytocin makes it feel right. Selank keeps the false alarm quiet. All three injected at the same time.`,
