    plainEnglish:`Think of this as four completely separate renovation crews working on four different sections of the building simultaneously.\n\nLibido, skin, body composition, and sleep each have their own root cause — and their own dedicated crew in this stack. None of them are doing the same job.\n\n**PT-141 — The Main Power Switch**\n\nActivates the brain's desire circuit at MC4R in the hypothalamus — the main power switch for the building's hospitality wing. FDA-approved specifically for women (Vyleesi). As-needed only, maximum 2x per week.\n\n**GHK-Cu — The Blueprint Reset**\n\nResets 4,000+ genes back toward what they looked like when the building was new. Collagen production restarts. Elastin gets ordered. Hair follicle maintenance resumes. The skin and tissue instructions get restored from the inside.\n\n**CJC-1295 + Ipamorelin — The Night Shift**\n\nDispatch memo and direct call — two separate channels getting the overnight foreman on site. Better body composition, better sleep, better overnight tissue repair. The night shift that GHK-Cu's blueprint instructions actually get executed on.\n\n| Compound | Role |\n|---|---|\n| PT-141 | Main power switch for the brain's desire circuit — as needed |\n| GHK-Cu | Blueprint reset — skin, collagen, hair renewal instructions restored |\n| CJC-1295 (no DAC) | Dispatch memo scheduling the overnight foreman |\n| Ipamorelin | Direct call ensuring the foreman shows up |\n\n---\n\nFour crews, four completely different sections of the building. PT-141 is as-needed. GHK-Cu is daily. CJC-1295 + Ipamorelin is one injection before bed. Simple protocol, four separate jobs.`,
